  '<strong>Application</strong> means the software program provided by the Company downloaded by You on any electronic device named {brand}.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page disclaimer.astro. Message key `application_definition` (Application Definition).',
