  '<strong>If Capgo is down:</strong> in background mode, this is usually invisible to users. In direct mode, the service may return a 5xx response when reachable; if the server is simply too slow, the plugin waits up to 3 seconds, cancels the query, and continues normal app startup.': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `support_policy_service_disruption_if_capgo_down` (Support Policy Service Disruption If Capgo Down).',
  '<strong>If payment is stopped or billing is canceled:</strong> the last successfully installed update remains on each device, but no new updates are downloaded.': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Message key `support_policy_service_disruption_if_billing_stopped` (Support Policy Service Disruption If Billing Stopped).',
  '<strong>If traffic goes beyond your plan:</strong> no devices (new or old) will receive additional updates until the plan is back in scope.': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Message key `support_policy_service_disruption_if_over_limit` (Support Policy Service Disruption If Over Limit).',
