  'Appflow also builds React Native and native iOS and Android apps. Capgo Builder targets Capacitor apps, so those projects need another build service.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `compare_appflow_better_2_text` (Compare Appflow Better 2 Text).',
  'Appflow bundled CI, live updates, and store publishing for Ionic apps. Ionic is winding the product down — teams need a migration plan.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page reviews/appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `review_appflow_hero_subtitle` (Review Appflow Hero Subtitle).',
  'Appflow bundles CI/CD automations in the same dashboard. Capgo does not replace your pipeline: you trigger Capgo from GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, or Jenkins.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `compare_appflow_better_3_text` (Compare Appflow Better 3 Text).',
  'Appflow connected git repos to cloud builds, channel-based live updates, and store submission helpers. It worked well if your stack stayed inside Ionic’s toolchain.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page reviews/appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `review_appflow_what_p1` (Review Appflow What P1).',
