  'Appflow docs: Live Update channels': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `compare_appflow_source_channels` (Compare Appflow Source Channels).',
  'Appflow documentation overview': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives.astro, page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `compare_appflow_source_docs` (Compare Appflow Source Docs).',
  'Appflow is winding down. Compare live updates, native builds, and migration paths for Ionic and Capacitor apps.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: SEO meta description. Seen in: page best/appflow-alternative.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `best_appflow_alternative_meta_description` (Best Appflow Alternative Meta Description).',
  'Appflow Live Updates started at $499/month and is no longer sold to new customers. Capgo starts at $12/month billed yearly ($14 billed monthly), with a 14-day free trial and no credit card required.': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro, page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_faq_a3` (Appflow FAQ A3).',
  'Appflow matched live updates to native versions for you. In Capgo you get the same result with channels and version rules:': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/version-targeting.astro, page solutions/version-targeting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_version_targeting_appflow_desc` (Solutions Version Targeting Appflow Desc).',
  'Appflow migration': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page solutions/version-targeting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_version_targeting_appflow_badge` (Solutions Version Targeting Appflow Badge).',
  'Appflow migration guide': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page solutions/version-targeting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_version_targeting_link_appflow` (Solutions Version Targeting Link Appflow).',
