  'Appflow replacement': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page solutions/ionic-enterprise-plugins.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_ionic_enterprise_plugins_support3_title` (Solutions Ionic Enterprise Plugins Support3 Title).',
  'Appflow stores your Apple ID and app-specific password to upload binaries. Capgo uses App Store Connect API keys (.p8): scoped, revocable, and independent of personal Apple ID password changes. For cloud builds, credentials are only used in ephemeral environments — not parked on a vendor server indefinitely.': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro, page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_faq_a5` (Appflow FAQ A5).',
  'Appflow to Capgo migration guide': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/ionic-enterprise-plugins.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_ionic_enterprise_plugins_link_appflow` (Solutions Ionic Enterprise Plugins Link Appflow).',
  'Apple account setup': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Message key `solutions_build_without_mac_normal1_title` (Solutions Build Without Mac Normal1 Title).',
