  'At the end of the contract, the client needs the app, the access, and the release setup, not a document that describes them.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/agencies.astro, page solutions/agencies.astro. Message key `solutions_agencies_pain6_desc` (Solutions Agencies Pain6 Desc).',
