  'Bandwidth only counts the bytes a device actually downloads from Capgo. With Delta updates (upload with --delta), a device downloads only the files that changed since the version it already has, so unchanged files cost nothing. Any file or full zip already cached at the edge does not count. If a download is interrupted, it resumes where it stopped, so the part already downloaded is not counted again.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: component pricing/Faq.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `bandwidth_explanation` (Bandwidth Explanation).',
  'Banking and money apps with accounts, payments, offers, investments, and support flows have to move quickly while preserving trust. Capgo fits fixes that can be shipped through the approved web layer and expanded gradually.': 'Page/area: Solution page app examples section. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solution_app_examples_fintech_use_case` (Solution App Examples Fintech Use Case).',
