  'Build on dedicated Mac Mini Silicon M4 machines without installing Xcode or Android Studio everywhere.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Message key `native_build_builder_feature_no_setup_text` (Native Build Builder Feature No Setup Text).',
