  'Build signed iOS and Android releases from your machine or CI while keeping Capgo\'s existing site header, docs, and pricing flow.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_builder_cta_text` (Native Build Builder CTA Text).',
