  'Build the web layer with the tenant\'s theme and config, then upload it to that tenant\'s channel only. Other tenants keep their current bundle.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/white-label.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_white_label_how2_body` (Solutions White Label How2 Body).',
  'Build time refers to the time Capgo spends building your native app in the cloud using Capgo Build, our cloud-based solution for iOS and Android. It allows you to build your app from any computer without needing a Mac, simplifies CI/CD workflows, and enables teammates who are not familiar with native builds to generate builds reliably. Using the Capgo CLI, you can trigger builds in a simple and reproducible way, often faster and easier than managing your own CI/CD setup.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: component pricing/Faq.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `build_time_explanation` (Build Time Explanation).',
