  'Capacitor and Ionic developers, agencies with client apps, and product teams who need to ship mobile fixes without store delay.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page affiliate.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `affiliate_faq_a5` (Affiliate FAQ A5).',
  'Capacitor and Ionic teams shipping JavaScript OTA to iOS and Android production apps': 'Page/area: About Capgo page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page about.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `about_who_icp_capacitor` (About Who Icp Capacitor).',
  'Capacitor and mobile development guides, tutorials, and best practices for building modern apps.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Supporting description paragraph or meta description. Seen in: component BlogListing.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `articles_description` (Articles Description).',
  'Capacitor app': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page solutions/white-label.astro, page solutions/white-label.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_white_label_visual_cell1_value` (Solutions White Label Visual Cell1 Value).',
  'Capacitor apps built with React, Vue, Angular, Svelte, Ionic, or any web framework. Live updates also work for Cordova and Electron. Not for React Native.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component comparison/ComparisonPage.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `compare_capgo_frameworks` (Compare Capgo Frameworks).',
  'Capacitor can run many Cordova plugins, so you can keep some while you migrate. For login, payments, storage, and other critical paths, use a maintained Capacitor plugin. Capgo plugins are free under MPL-2.0.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_faq2_a` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Faq2 A).',
  'Capacitor gives your web app a native shell. Capgo builds it, sends it to the stores, and keeps it updated.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/webapp-to-mobile.astro, page solutions/webapp-to-mobile.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_webapp_to_mobile_cap_lead` (Solutions Webapp To Mobile Cap Lead).',
  'Capacitor iOS and Android projects in your repo that build in Xcode and Android Studio': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor.astro, page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_deliverable1` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Deliverable1).',
  'Capacitor is a native app that hosts your web app. You commit real Xcode and Android Studio projects, keep your existing web code, and replace Cordova plugins with Capacitor plugins. That makes the work easy to split into small steps an agent can do and you can review.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor-ai.astro, page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor-ai.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_ai_section_changes_body` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Ai Section Changes Body).',
  'Capacitor Live Update - Capgo Cloud': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: SEO component. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `website_title` (Website Title).',
  'Capacitor live update plans': 'Page/area: Pricing page or plan calculator UI. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page pricing.astro, page pricing.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `pricing_seo_tagline` (Pricing SEO Tagline).',
