  'Capacitor live updates with channels, rollback, and CLI checks. The EAS Update analog if you have a web app instead of React Native.': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Supporting description paragraph or meta description. Seen in: page live-update.astro, page live-update.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `live_update_description` (Live Update Description).',
  'Capacitor loads your built files from one folder (webDir). Vite, Angular, and Vue produce that by default. Next.js needs a static export.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_webapp_to_mobile_source1_desc` (Solutions Webapp To Mobile Source1 Desc).',
  'Capacitor path': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page reviews/codepush.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `review_codepush_capgo_title` (Review Codepush Capgo Title).',
