  'Capgo Builder receives the platform folder and built web assets needed for the requested native target.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_builder_security_upload_text` (Native Build Builder Security Upload Text).',
  'Capgo Builder runs native build jobs on dedicated Apple Silicon machines with the mobile SDKs already installed, so teams get repeatable iOS and Android output from any local or CI trigger.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_builder_infra_text` (Native Build Builder Infra Text).',
  'Capgo Builder supports iOS and Android builds for Capacitor apps, including store submission workflows and downloadable signed artifacts.': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: FAQ question or answer. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_builder_faq_platforms_a` (Native Build Builder FAQ Platforms A).',
