  'Capgo builds and updates it': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section or page heading. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_lovable_to_mobile_example3_title` (Solutions Lovable To Mobile Example3 Title).',
  'Capgo captures the full OTA journey: checks, downloads, installs, policy blocks, and rollbacks so you can answer “what happened?” in seconds, not hours.': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component landing/DeviceLogs.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `live_update_logs_desc` (Live Update Logs Desc).',
  'Capgo channels are live controls, not hardcoded. Move users between dev, staging, PR, canary, and production from your app UI or via API instantly.': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page live-update.astro, page live-update.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `live_update_dynamic_desc` (Live Update Dynamic Desc).',
