  'Capgo CLI keeps releases scriptable from laptop, CI, or an AI agent without living in a dashboard.': 'Page/area: CLI product or documentation marketing copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page capgo-cli.astro, page capgo-cli.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `cli_v2_comp_callout` (CLI V2 Comp Callout).',
