  'Capgo compares file checksums with what devices already have.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component explainers/ReleaseExplainers.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `explainer_delta_step_2` (Explainer Delta Step 2).',
  'Capgo console channel list used to manage releases for a private app': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Image alt text. Seen in: page solutions/set-and-forget.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_set_and_forget_image_alt` (Solutions Set And Forget Image Alt).',
  'Capgo covers the four EAS release jobs for a Capacitor app. EAS Hosting deploys Expo Router websites, which Capgo does not offer.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives/expo.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `compare_expo_map_lead` (Compare Expo Map Lead).',
  'Capgo covers the full path from your web bundle to devices in the field: upload, sign, encrypt, route through channels, deliver OTA, observe health, and recover when something goes wrong.': 'Page/area: About Capgo page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page about.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `about_what_does_intro` (About What Does Intro).',
  'Capgo covers what Appflow teams use most, live updates with channels and rollback plus cloud native builds, and keeps running after 2027. Migration swaps one plugin and your upload step.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page alternatives.astro, page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `compare_appflow_verdict` (Compare Appflow Verdict).',
  'Capgo Customer Support': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `support_policy_title` (Support Policy Title).',
  'Capgo customer support policy and response times. Learn about our support channels, SLA, and how we help you succeed with live updates.': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Supporting description paragraph or meta description. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `support_policy_description` (Support Policy Description).',
  'Capgo customers pay every month. So do we — to you.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page affiliate.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `affiliate_examples_subtitle` (Affiliate Examples Subtitle).',
  'Capgo customers\' data': 'Page/area: Security documentation or trust copy. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page security.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `security_disclosure_guidelines_2_2` (Security Disclosure Guidelines 2 2).',
  'Capgo Data Processing Agreement and GDPR compliance documentation for enterprise customers using our live update platform.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Supporting description paragraph or meta description. Seen in: page dp.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dp_description` (Dp Description).',
  'Capgo delivers 1B+ updates per month to 90M+ devices. Live status and incident history are public at status.capgo.app.': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro, page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_faq_a4` (Appflow FAQ A4).',
  'Capgo delivers the Capacitor web layer: JavaScript, CSS, and assets. It does not change the native binary, plugins, permissions, entitlements, or app-store metadata. Store review is app-specific, so you remain responsible for policy compliance and approval.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro, page solutions/production-updates.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_benefit3_desc` (Solutions Benefit3 Desc).',
  'Capgo does not have a release scheduler. Trigger the upload from your CI at the time you choose, for example with a scheduled GitHub Actions workflow or a manual run on launch morning. If the new UI must stay hidden until a date, gate it in your app or backend.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/qsr.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_qsr_faq1_a` (Solutions Qsr Faq1 A).',
  'Capgo does not use the app-scoped device identifier for advertising, profiling, or tracking users across apps, websites, or Capgo customers. The identifier is scoped to one app and used only for live-update operation and related reliability, support, billing de-duplication, and security purposes.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `data_policy_no_tracking` (Data Policy No Tracking).',
  'Capgo enables development teams at some of the most innovative companies.': 'Page/area: Capgo brand/product marketing copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component companies-logo.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `capgo_enables_development_teams_at_some_of_the_most_innovative_companies` (Capgo Enables Development Teams At Some Of The Most Innovative Companies).',
  'Capgo Enterprise': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page enterprise.astro, page enterprise.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `enterprise_procurement_visual_signature` (Enterprise Procurement Visual Signature).',
  'Capgo Enterprise keeps the urgency of live updates while giving larger teams the governance, support, and deployment options they need for production mobile apps.': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page enterprise.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `enterprise_decision_criteria_desc` (Enterprise Decision Criteria Desc).',
