  'Do I need to be a Capgo customer?': 'Page/area: Homepage problem/solution section. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page premium-support.astro, page premium-support.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `ps_faq_q5` (Ps FAQ Q5).',
