  'Each brand app and each market can need different menus, promotions, and legal text from the same codebase.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/qsr.astro, page solutions/qsr.astro. Message key `solutions_qsr_pain2_desc` (Solutions Qsr Pain2 Desc).',
