  'In order for the Goods to be eligible for a return, please make sure that:': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page return.astro. Message key `return_eligibility` (Return Eligibility).',
  'In order to exercise any of Your rights under the CCPA, and if You are a California resident, You can contact Us:': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_exercising_rights_contact` (Data Policy CCPA Exercising Rights Contact).',
  'In order to exercise Your right of cancellation, You must inform Us of your decision by means of a clear statement. You can inform us of your decision by:': 'Page/area: How it works section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page return.astro. Message key `how_to_cancel` (How To Cancel).',
  'In order to protect our customers, do not reveal the problem to others until we have researched, addressed and informed our affected customers.': 'Page/area: Security documentation or trust copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page security.astro. Message key `security_disclosure_guidelines_1` (Security Disclosure Guidelines 1).',
  'In order to use our products and services, you need to accept our DPA. By using our product you are agreeing to our terms of service, and you are automatically accepting our DPA and do not need to sign a separate document. We provide the same privacy rights and protection to all customers.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Message key `dpa_signing_required_1` (DPA Signing Required 1).',
  'in prepaid credits': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: UI label. Seen in: page native-build.astro, page native-build.astro. Message key `native_build_v2_calc_price_label` (Native Build V2 Calc Price Label).',
  'in seconds (no reinstall).': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Message key `live_update_dynamic_bullet1_suffix` (Live Update Dynamic Bullet1 Suffix).',
  'In September 2026 Ionic named Capawesome its preferred migration partner for Appflow and its enterprise plugins. Capgo has never been an Ionic partner. For years we built open alternatives to Ionic\'s paid products and fixed gaps in the Capacitor ecosystem ourselves, often going further than Ionic\'s own team, which never made us a fit for their program. Capawesome has always worked the way Ionic prefers. Partner status is a business relationship, not a technical ranking: Capgo and Capawesome have both moved Appflow customers, so compare the products on their merits.': 'Page/area: Appflow comparison / migration marketing copy. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page alternatives/capawesome.astro, page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `appflow_faq_a6` (Appflow FAQ A6).',
  'In such cases, no refund shall be issued for any remaining subscription or service period, unless required by law.': 'Page/area: Terms of Service legal page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page tos.astro. Message key `tos_right_to_refuse_or_terminate_service_text_5` (Terms of Service Right To Refuse Or Terminate Service Text 5).',
  'In the course of providing the Capgo service to user pursuant to the agreement, Capgo may process service data on behalf of user.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dpa_definitions_1` (DPA Definitions 1).',
  'In the default mode, updates apply between sessions, not in the middle of one': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro, page solutions/production-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_benefit1_point3` (Solutions Benefit1 Point3).',
  'In the default mode, updates apply when the app goes to the background, which a kiosk rarely does. Set autoUpdate to \'always\' to apply updates during the periodic check (every 10 minutes by default), or to \'onlyDownload\' and call set() when the kiosk returns to its idle screen.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/qsr.astro. Message key `solutions_qsr_faq2_a` (Solutions Qsr Faq2 A).',
  'In the public information concerning the problem reported, we will give your name as the discoverer of the problem (unless you desire otherwise).': 'Page/area: Security documentation or trust copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page security.astro. Message key `security_what_we_promise_5` (Security What We Promise 5).',
  'In this Data Processing Agreement ("DPA"), "Data Protection Legislation" means the General Data Protection Regulation (Regulation (EU) 2016/279), and all other applicable laws relating to processing of service data and privacy that may exist in any relevant jurisdiction.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Message key `dpa_definitions_2` (DPA Definitions 2).',
