  'It all started with a GitHub issue where many developers voiced their frustration with the high costs of existing solutions like Appflow.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `it_all_started_with_a_github_issue_where_many_developers_voiced_their_frustration_with_the_high_costs_of_existing_solutions_like_appflow` (It All Started With A Github Issue Where Many Developers Voiced Their Frustration With The High Costs Of Existing Solutions Like Appflow).',
  'It can do most of the mechanical work: adding Capacitor, moving config.xml settings, and swapping plugins. You still review the changes, test on real devices, and handle signing and the store release.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor-ai.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_ai_faq1_a` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Ai Faq1 A).',
