  'It is important to document all public APIs and we want to do that inline with the code. This helps ensure that code and documentation are tightly coupled together.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page contributing.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `importance_of_documenting_apis` (Importance Of Documenting Apis).',
  'It replaces the credential vault: save, check, read, and delete credentials with biometric-protected reads. Timeout locks and privacy screens become app code, and custom-passcode and memory-only modes are not supported.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/ionic-enterprise-plugins.astro. Message key `solutions_ionic_enterprise_plugins_faq2_a` (Solutions Ionic Enterprise Plugins Faq2 A).',
