  'Most programs pay once. We do not.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page affiliate.astro. Message key `affiliate_compare_title` (Affiliate Compare Title).',
  'Most teams are live within a day. Sign up, create an app, connect a channel, upload a bundle, and devices pull the update on the next launch or background check.': 'Page/area: About Capgo page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page about.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `about_how_intro` (About How Intro).',
  'Most tools can upload files. Capgo adds the release controls, native safety, logs, and rollback behavior production teams need.': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `live_update_features_subtitle` (Live Update Features Subtitle).',
  'Most web apps work inside Capacitor with few changes. These three checks catch the common problems early.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/webapp-to-mobile.astro, page solutions/webapp-to-mobile.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_webapp_to_mobile_source_lead` (Solutions Webapp To Mobile Source Lead).',
  'Mostly app-layer delivery. JS errors can block or corrupt the update flow.': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page live-update.astro, page live-update.astro. Message key `live_update_v2_comp_runtime_capa` (Live Update V2 Comp Runtime Capa).',
  'Move a Cordova app to Capacitor without a rewrite: free MPL-2.0 Capgo plugins, live updates, cloud builds, and a team that can run the migration for you.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Supporting description paragraph or meta description. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor.astro, page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_description` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Description).',
