  'No bundles; the app loads your website': 'Page/area: Capacitor live-update alternatives comparison page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `alternatives_sum_median_live` (Alternatives Sum Median Live).',
