  'no devices (new or old) will receive additional updates until the plan is back in scope.': 'HTML text fragment from a longer Capgo UI string (parent key `support_policy_service_disruption_if_over_limit`). Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Message key `support_policy_service_disruption_if_over_limit` (Support Policy Service Disruption If Over Limit).',
