  'No first-class CLI. Releases stay in the dashboard or git-triggered flows.': 'Page/area: CLI product or documentation marketing copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page capgo-cli.astro, page capgo-cli.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `cli_v2_comp_cli_capa` (CLI V2 Comp CLI Capa).',
  'No guardrails unless you build them.': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page live-update.astro, page live-update.astro. Message key `live_update_v2_comp_compat_diy` (Live Update V2 Comp Compat Diy).',
  'No guardrails unless you built them.': 'Page/area: CLI product or documentation marketing copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page capgo-cli.astro, page capgo-cli.astro. Message key `cli_v2_comp_compat_diy` (CLI V2 Comp Compat Diy).',
  'No hardcoded values in your app - everything can be changed dynamically without a new binary': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Message key `live_update_cloud_config_bullet3` (Live Update Cloud Config Bullet3).',
  'no hesitation in recommending Capgo': 'HTML text fragment from a longer Capgo UI string (parent key `testimonial_consulting_2`). Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page consulting.astro, page consulting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `testimonial_consulting_2` (Testimonial Consulting 2).',
  'No hosted plan since App Center was retired on March 31, 2025. The standalone server is free under MIT; you pay for the infrastructure you run it on.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives/codepush.astro. Message key `compare_codepush_pricing` (Compare Codepush Pricing).',
  'No Illegal, Harmful, or Offensive Use or Content': 'Page/area: Acceptable Use Policy legal page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page aup.astro. Message key `aup_no_illegal_use` (Acceptable Use Policy No Illegal Use).',
  'No interruption': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro, page solutions/production-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_solution_step2_time` (Solutions Solution Step2 Time).',
  'No investors, no pressure to sell. Built with our own resources and customer revenue.': 'Page/area: Homepage marketing copy. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component AppflowShutdown.astro. Message key `home_bootstrapped_desc` (Home Bootstrapped Desc).',
