  'Skills give your agent a tested playbook instead of guesses. The cordova-to-capacitor skill covers the migration order. capacitor-plugins helps pick and install plugins, and capgo-live-updates sets up the updater after the move. The skills are open source and install with one command.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor-ai.astro, page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor-ai.astro. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_ai_section_skills_body` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Ai Section Skills Body).',
