  'SOC 2 refers to SOC 2 Type II certification, a recognized security compliance standard. Capgo is SOC 2 Type II certified, meaning its systems and processes are independently audited to ensure high standards of security, availability, and confidentiality, including data protection, access controls, service reliability, and safe data handling. In practice, this means Capgo follows enterprise-grade security practices and can be used by companies with compliance requirements, corporate clients, and B2B or regulated environments. SOC 2 coverage and the audit report are available on the Enterprise plan only.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: component pricing/Faq.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `soc2_explanation` (Soc2 Explanation).',
  'SOC 2 report, DPA template, architecture notes, signing, encryption, and access-control answers.': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page enterprise.astro, page enterprise.astro. Message key `enterprise_procurement_security_desc` (Enterprise Procurement Security Desc).',
