  'Testers install your app once. After that, each JavaScript, HTML, or CSS change goes to a beta channel they joined from the app, and they get it on the next update check. Changes to native code still go through TestFlight or a Play testing track.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/beta-testing.astro, page solutions/beta-testing.astro. Message key `solutions_beta_testing_hero_subtitle` (Solutions Beta Testing Hero Subtitle).',
