  'The default mode applies updates when the app goes to the background, which a kiosk rarely does. Download updates automatically and apply them when the kiosk is idle.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/qsr.astro, page solutions/qsr.astro. Message key `solutions_qsr_sol4_desc` (Solutions Qsr Sol4 Desc).',
  'The device rebuilds 1.0.1 from files it already has, verifies it, and waits for next launch.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component explainers/ReleaseExplainers.astro. Message key `explainer_delta_step_4` (Explainer Delta Step 4).',
  'The EAS Build and EAS Submit equivalent for Capacitor': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page native-build.astro, page native-build.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `native_build_v2_eas_title` (Native Build V2 Eas Title).',
