  'The Enterprise plan comes with SOC 2 Type II and ISO 27001, a DPA, SSO, and a published sub-processor list for your vendor review.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/fintech.astro, page solutions/fintech.astro. Message key `solutions_fintech_cert1_desc` (Solutions Fintech Cert1 Desc).',
  'The Enterprise plan offers dedicated, hybrid, and licensed self-hosted setups. You can also run your own update server with the open-source updater, but then you build features such as channels and statistics yourself.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/set-and-forget.astro. Message key `solutions_set_and_forget_faq5_a` (Solutions Set And Forget Faq5 A).',
