  'The Expo Free plan includes 1,000 update MAU and up to 15 Android and 15 iOS builds. Capgo has a 14-day trial but no free plan.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives/expo.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `compare_expo_better_2_text` (Compare Expo Better 2 Text).',
  'The fix is in the web layer, but a store-only process means a new binary and store review, which is often 24–48 hours, sometimes much longer.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/qsr.astro, page solutions/qsr.astro. Message key `solutions_qsr_nightmare_para2` (Solutions Qsr Nightmare Para2).',
  'The fix is ready before the release process is.': 'Page/area: Enterprise product/pricing page. Role: Section or page heading. Seen in: page enterprise.astro, page enterprise.astro. Message key `enterprise_pain_incident_title` (Enterprise Pain Incident Title).',
