  'The goal of Capgo is to operate live updates reliably, not to track individual users across apps, websites, or Capgo customers. Capgo uses the data needed for update eligibility, monthly active device de-duplication, support, abuse prevention, and operational reliability.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `data_policy_goal` (Data Policy Goal).',
