  'The init command walks you through adding the updater plugin, building, and uploading your first bundle.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/solo-developers.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_solo_how1_body` (Solutions Solo How1 Body). | Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/startups.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_startups_how1_body` (Solutions Startups How1 Body).',
