  'The license that is granted to You by the Company is solely for your personal, non-commercial purposes strictly in accordance with the terms of this Agreement.': 'Page/area: End User License Agreement legal page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page eula.astro. Message key `eula_license_scope_text_3` (EULA License Scope Text 3).',
  'The local server can list and create apps, upload and list bundles, manage channels, check native compatibility, read stats, and request native builds. It uses your Capgo CLI login.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor-ai.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_ai_faq3_a` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Ai Faq3 A).',
  'The MCP servers, skills, and CLI are free to use. You need a Capgo plan, and every plan starts with a 14-day free trial with no credit card. Builds, live updates, and Observe are in every plan.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: FAQ question or answer. Seen in: page agents/[slug].astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `agents_page_faq_price_a` (Agents Page FAQ Price A).',
  'The Median Free license lets you build and test a non-commercial app at no cost, with a Powered by Median.co message on launch.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives/median.astro. Message key `compare_median_better_3_text` (Compare Median Better 3 Text).',
  'The migration changes the native layer and the release process. Your product stays the same for your users.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Supporting note or footnote. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor.astro, page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor.astro. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_scope_note` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Scope Note).',
  'The native shell stays shared. Each tenant\'s web layer moves through its own channel.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/white-label.astro, page solutions/white-label.astro. Message key `solutions_white_label_system_lead` (Solutions White Label System Lead).',
  'The new bundle downloads while the user keeps using the current version. With delta updates, only changed files download.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro, page solutions/production-updates.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_solution_step2_desc` (Solutions Solution Step2 Desc).',
  'The official guide covers the plugin swap, configuration, and CI changes. Ionic enterprise plugins have direct Capgo replacements listed below.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives/ionic-appflow.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `compare_appflow_migration_lead` (Compare Appflow Migration Lead).',
  'The onboarding adds your app to Capgo, creates a production channel, installs the updater plugin, and walks you through a first test update.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/webapp-to-mobile.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_webapp_to_mobile_how2_body` (Solutions Webapp To Mobile How2 Body).',
  'The onboarding reads your Capacitor project, creates the distribution certificate and provisioning profile, and saves them on your machine.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/build-without-mac.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_build_without_mac_how1_body` (Solutions Build Without Mac How1 Body).',
