  'The right not to be discriminated against. You have the right not to be discriminated against for exercising any of Your consumer\'s rights, including by:': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_right_to_non_discrimination` (Data Policy CCPA Right To Non Discrimination).',
  'The right to delete Personal Data. You have the right to request the deletion of Your Personal Data, subject to certain exceptions. Once We receive and confirm Your request, We will delete (and direct Our Service Providers to delete) Your personal information from our records, unless an exception applies. We may deny Your deletion request if retaining the information is necessary for Us or Our Service Providers to:': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_right_to_delete` (Data Policy CCPA Right To Delete).',
  'The right to notice. You have the right to be notified which categories of Personal Data are being collected and the purposes for which the Personal Data is being used.': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_right_to_notice` (Data Policy CCPA Right To Notice).',
  'The right to request. Under CCPA, You have the right to request that We disclose information to You about Our collection, use, sale, disclosure for business purposes and share of personal information. Once We receive and confirm Your request, We will disclose to You:': 'Page/area: Data / CCPA privacy policy page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dp.astro. Message key `data_policy_ccpa_right_to_request` (Data Policy CCPA Right To Request).',
