  'The same web fix goes through the App Store and Google Play separately, each with its own review and release.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_cost_damage_explanation` (Solutions Cost Damage Explanation).',
