  'The update system is designed to fail safe. If Capgo is unavailable, the app keeps running and no user-facing freeze is introduced by the update check.': 'Page/area: Support / premium support page or footer support section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page support-policy.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `support_policy_service_disruption_intro` (Support Policy Service Disruption Intro).',
  'The updater checks and downloads the changed files': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro, page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_d_step2` (Solutions Direct D Step2).',
  'The updater checks at launch while your splash screen stays up. If a new bundle is available, it downloads and applies it before the splash screen hides.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro, page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_direct_solution_subtitle` (Solutions Direct Solution Subtitle).',
  'The updater plugin and much of the Capgo ecosystem are open source. Teams can self-host, read the code, and avoid black-box release pipelines that are hard to validate for security or compliance reviews.': 'Page/area: About Capgo page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page about.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `about_diff_opensource_body` (About Diff Opensource Body).',
  'The updater plugin and the Capgo backend are open source on GitHub. Your security team can read the code that downloads, checks, and installs bundles on your users\' devices.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/fintech.astro, page solutions/fintech.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_fintech_opensource_desc` (Solutions Fintech Opensource Desc).',
  'The updater plugin and the Capgo backend are open source on GitHub. Your team can read the code that runs on patient devices.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/healthcare.astro, page solutions/healthcare.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_healthcare_cert3_desc` (Solutions Healthcare Cert3 Desc).',
  'The user leaves the app. The new bundle waits, ready for the next launch.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component explainers/ReleaseExplainers.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `explainer_next_launch_step_4` (Explainer Next Launch Step 4).',
