  'The wait at launch is the update check plus the download. Delta updates keep the download to the files that changed.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro, page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_speed_subtitle` (Solutions Direct Speed Subtitle).',
