  'The web UI shows rollout health, blocked devices, failed installs, rollbacks, and native compatibility warnings in the same release view.': 'Page/area: Homepage landing product feature section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: component landing/ReleaseIntelligence.astro. Message key `landing_release_intelligence_card_dashboard_desc` (Landing Release Intelligence Card Dashboard Desc).',
