  'Their store publishing covers TestFlight, Google Play, Huawei AppGallery, and Firebase App Distribution.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives/capawesome.astro. Message key `compare_capawesome_better_3_text` (Compare Capawesome Better 3 Text).',
