  'There are numerous repositories in the Capgo organization that are part of the Capgo ecosystem.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `there_are_numerous_repositories_in_the_capgo_organization_that_are_part_of_the_capgo` (There Are Numerous Repositories In The Capgo Organization That Are Part Of The Capgo).',
  'There is no code migration from React Native to Capacitor. The path is to keep your web app and wrap it, then ship it with Capgo.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives/expo.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `compare_expo_migration_lead` (Compare Expo Migration Lead).',
  'There is no on-call teammate to revert a release. Rollback has to be yours.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/solo-developers.astro, page solutions/solo-developers.astro. Message key `solutions_solo_pain5_desc` (Solutions Solo Pain5 Desc).',
  'These apps are built with Capacitor: web code in a native iOS and Android shell, the same model your Cordova app moves to.': 'Page/area: Solution page app examples section. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solution_app_examples_cordova_to_capacitor_use_case` (Solution App Examples Cordova To Capacitor Use Case).',
  'These are real Capgo screens. Roll a bundle out to part of your users, watch it land, catch updates that need a native build, ship store builds, and reach users with push.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: component PlatformScreens.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `platform_screens_subtitle` (Platform Screens Subtitle).',
