  'These prompts are designed to produce usable outputs (tables, checklists, plans), not vague advice.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor-ai.astro, page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor-ai.astro. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_ai_section_prompts_body` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Ai Section Prompts Body).',
  'These Terms and Conditions may have been translated if We have made them available to You on our Service. You agree that the original English text shall prevail in the case of a dispute.': 'Page/area: Terms of Service legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page tos.astro. Message key `tos_translation_text` (Terms of Service Translation Text).',
  'They help {brand} build tools customers need, from Capacitor plugins to product features.': 'Page/area: Integrations marketing section. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page integrations.astro, page integrations.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `integrations_partners_freelance_capgo_work` (Integrations Partners Freelance Capgo Work).',
  'They join the channel from your app, or you set a device override': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/beta-testing.astro, page solutions/beta-testing.astro. Message key `solutions_beta_testing_compare_distribution_capgo` (Solutions Beta Testing Compare Distribution Capgo).',
  'They keep receiving bundles that are compatible with their native version. With the metadata strategy, a bundle whose minimum native version is above theirs is skipped, and they stay on their current bundle.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/version-targeting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_version_targeting_faq1_a` (Solutions Version Targeting Faq1 A).',
