  'This is not a consumer App Store bypass. It is a private-app operating model for teams that already self-distribute.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/set-and-forget.astro, page solutions/set-and-forget.astro. Message key `solutions_set_and_forget_boundary_4` (Solutions Set And Forget Boundary 4).',
