  'Upload with --delta so only changed files download': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro, page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_benefit3_point1` (Solutions Direct Benefit3 Point1).',
  'Upload with --rollout to send the bundle to a random, sticky share of the channel while everyone else stays on stable. Raise the percentage, promote, or roll back from the CLI or console. Auto-pause can stop exposure when the failure rate passes a threshold.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_production_updates_faq4_a` (Solutions Production Updates Faq4 A).',
  'Upload with delta updates enabled': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Message key `live_update_delta_command` (Live Update Delta Command).',
  'Uploader or UI incorrectly labeling encryption for bundles served via external_url is not a Capgo vulnerability (encryption of externally hosted bundles is outside Capgo’s control).': 'Page/area: Bug bounty program page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page bug-bounty.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `bug_bounty_out_of_scope_11` (Bug Bounty Out Of Scope 11). | Page/area: Security documentation or trust copy. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page security.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `security_out_of_scope_16` (Security Out Of Scope 16).',
  'Uploading a bundle is easy. Protecting customers at scale is the hard part.': 'Page/area: Live updates product page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `live_update_comparison_subtitle` (Live Update Comparison Subtitle).',
  'Uploading native project inputs': 'Page/area: Capgo Builder / native cloud build product page. Role: Website copy sentence. Message key `native_build_builder_terminal_upload` (Native Build Builder Terminal Upload).',
