  'Users update from the store at their own pace, so several native versions of your app are live at once. Capgo checks each bundle\'s native dependencies, blocks updates by version rules, and can route each native version to its own channel.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/version-targeting.astro, page solutions/version-targeting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_version_targeting_hero_subtitle` (Solutions Version Targeting Hero Subtitle).',
  'Users wait for the download at launch, and with always an update can reload the app while it is in use. Plan for both.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro, page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_benefit3_desc` (Solutions Direct Benefit3 Desc).',
  'Users wait for the download at launch, so send only the changed files. The CLI detects instant apply modes and prompts for a delta upload.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_direct_how3_body` (Solutions Direct How3 Body).',
