  'VoltBuilder homepage': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page alternatives.astro, page alternatives/voltbuilder.astro. Message key `compare_voltbuilder_source_home` (Compare Voltbuilder Source Home).',
  'VoltBuilder is a build service only. If you ship every change through the stores and never need live updates, it covers the job.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page alternatives/voltbuilder.astro. Message key `compare_voltbuilder_better_1_text` (Compare Voltbuilder Better 1 Text).',
