  'VoltBuilder plans': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Short UI label or navigation item. Seen in: page alternatives.astro, page alternatives/voltbuilder.astro. Message key `compare_voltbuilder_source_plans` (Compare Voltbuilder Source Plans).',
