  'When a clinician reports an issue, your team has to tell which bundle and native version that device runs.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/healthcare.astro, page solutions/healthcare.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_healthcare_pain3_desc` (Solutions Healthcare Pain3 Desc).',
  'When a fix only touches the web layer of your Capacitor app, ship it as an encrypted live update. Test it on a staging channel, roll it out in steps, and keep a record of every release for your compliance team.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/healthcare.astro, page solutions/healthcare.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_healthcare_hero_subtitle` (Solutions Healthcare Hero Subtitle).',
  'When a fix only touches the web layer of your Capacitor app, ship it as an encrypted, signed live update. Stage it on a channel, roll it out by percentage, and keep a record of who shipped what.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/fintech.astro, page solutions/fintech.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_fintech_hero_subtitle` (Solutions Fintech Hero Subtitle).',
  'When a production bug hits a Capacitor app, waiting 24–48 hours for App Store or Play review is too slow. Teams need a fix out today, with a rollback if it misses.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page affiliate.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `affiliate_problem` (Affiliate Problem).',
  'When a sale banner, promo code field, or checkout step needs a web-layer fix, upload it with the Capgo CLI. Test it on a staging channel, send it to a share of shoppers, and roll it back if checkout looks wrong.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Section subtitle or tagline. Seen in: page solutions/ecommerce.astro, page solutions/ecommerce.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_ecommerce_hero_subtitle` (Solutions Ecommerce Hero Subtitle).',
  'When a tenant needs its own store listing, icon, or permissions, build that flavor or scheme with Capgo Build. No Mac of your own needed.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/white-label.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_white_label_how4_body` (Solutions White Label How4 Body).',
  'When a web-layer bug is live, ship the fix through Capgo instead of waiting days for app store approval. Users get the update in the background while native changes stay in the normal review path.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Supporting description paragraph or meta description. Seen in: component BlogListing.astro, component GetStarted.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `instant_updates_for_capacitor_apps_description` (Instant Updates For Capacitor Apps Description).',
  'When an application works too slow or gets down (even for a few minutes), it can damage users\' satisfaction and decrease the revenue. To avoid such situations, review the code to find areas for improvement.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page consulting.astro, page consulting.astro. Message key `when_down_review` (When Down Review).',
  'When developing a CapacitorJS app as a beginner, it\'s good to have an experienced consultant by your side.': 'Page/area: Capgo marketing website. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page consulting.astro, page consulting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `when_developing_a_capacitorjs_app_as_a_beginner_it_s_good_to_have_an_experienced_consultant_by_your_side` (When Developing A Capacitorjs App As A Beginner It S Good To Have An Experienced Consultant By Your Side).',
