  'When ordering works as expected, promote the bundle to every device on the channel.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/qsr.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_qsr_how3_body` (Solutions Qsr How3 Body).',
