  'When the developer who ran a client\'s releases leaves, the credentials and the process can leave with them.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/agencies.astro, page solutions/agencies.astro. Message key `solutions_agencies_pain3_desc` (Solutions Agencies Pain3 Desc).',
