  'When the new binary ships, upload its bundle without --fail-on-incompatible. Capgo raises the floor so older builds skip it, and later checks compare against the new native packages.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/version-targeting.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_version_targeting_how4_body` (Solutions Version Targeting How4 Body).',
  'When the numbers look right, promote the bundle to every device on the channel. If not, send the rollout cohort back to stable.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/production-updates.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_production_updates_how4_body` (Solutions Production Updates How4 Body).',
