  'When you upload a bundle, Capgo compares the native plugins in your project with the bundle live on the channel and tells you when a change needs a new store build.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor.astro, page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_benefit5_desc` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Benefit5 Desc).',
