  'With a store-only process, you build a new binary and submit it. Store review is often 24–48 hours, sometimes much longer.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/ecommerce.astro, page solutions/ecommerce.astro. Message key `solutions_ecommerce_nightmare_para2` (Solutions Ecommerce Nightmare Para2).',
