  'With always, periodic checks (every 10 minutes by default) can apply an update while the app is open. Save state before relying on it.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/direct-updates.astro, page solutions/direct-updates.astro. Message key `solutions_direct_usecase6_desc` (Solutions Direct Usecase6 Desc).',
