  'With Capgo Notifications set up, channel set --send-update-notification sends a silent update-check notification after you change the channel\'s bundle. Delivery is best effort and depends on the operating system, network, and device state. It cannot reach offline or force-quit apps.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page solutions/set-and-forget.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_set_and_forget_faq3_a` (Solutions Set And Forget Faq3 A).',
  'With GitHub sync on, Publish in Lovable pushes a commit. A GitHub Action builds the app and uploads the bundle, so installed apps get web changes without a new store release.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_lovable_to_mobile_playbook3_desc` (Solutions Lovable To Mobile Playbook3 Desc).',
  'With more than 500+ GitHub stars, there are a lot of eyes on our code and it is this transparency and openness that means that open source products can be more trustworthy than proprietary and closed source products. Our software is updated several times per week and on our GitHub page we also have a way for people to report any security vulnerabilities.': 'Page/area: Data Processing Agreement legal page. Role: Long marketing or legal paragraph. Seen in: page dpa.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `dpa_security_measures_3` (DPA Security Measures 3).',
