  'With self-assignment on, the app calls setChannel() to put a device on its tenant\'s channel. Capgo still validates the channel on every update check.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_white_label_system2_desc` (Solutions White Label System2 Desc).',
  'With the MCP server running, the agent can upload bundles, manage channels, and request native builds. Plugin changes still need a store release.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/cordova-to-capacitor-ai.astro. Preserve Capgo product/brand and developer terms exactly. Message key `solutions_cordova_to_capacitor_ai_how4_body` (Solutions Cordova To Capacitor Ai How4 Body).',
