  'You need to show which build is on production, who shipped it, and when.': 'Page/area: Capgo solutions marketing page. Role: Website copy sentence. Seen in: page solutions/agencies.astro, page solutions/agencies.astro. Message key `solutions_agencies_pain5_desc` (Solutions Agencies Pain5 Desc).',
